---
// src/pages/zero-spam-pledge.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Zero-Spam Pledge — VerseSEO"
  description="VerseSEO's commitment to authentic SEO and community participation. We don't encourage spam, fake engagement, or manipulative tactics."
  canonical="https://verseseo.com/zero-spam-pledge"
>
  <Navbar />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-2">Zero-Spam Pledge</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-10">Our commitment to authentic visibility</p>

      <div class="prose prose-slate prose-sm max-w-none space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">Our Commitment</h2>
          <p>VerseSEO exists to help people be genuinely visible — not to help them game systems, flood communities with noise, or manufacture fake engagement. We believe sustainable visibility comes from providing real value, and our product is built around that belief.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">What We Don't Do</h2>
          <p>VerseSEO does not encourage, facilitate, or enable:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Mass Reddit posting</strong> — We don't help you blast identical messages across dozens of subreddits.</li>
            <li><strong>Copied AI comments</strong> — We don't generate generic, AI-written responses to paste into community discussions.</li>
            <li><strong>Fake engagement</strong> — We don't help you simulate upvotes, comments, or other artificial social signals.</li>
            <li><strong>Keyword stuffing</strong> — We don't help you cram unnatural keyword repetitions into your content.</li>
            <li><strong>Automated community participation</strong> — We don't offer bots or automation tools for posting on behalf of users in forums, Reddit, or other platforms.</li>
            <li><strong>Manipulative tactics</strong> — We don't help you deceive search engines, AI platforms, or community moderators.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">What We Do Instead</h2>
          <p>VerseSEO helps you find opportunities where you can genuinely provide value:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Reddit Opportunity Listening</strong> — We surface relevant Reddit conversations where your expertise or product could genuinely help someone. You read the conversation, understand the context, and respond as a real person with something useful to say.</li>
            <li><strong>Search Discovery</strong> — We identify keywords and topics where your content can rank because it's genuinely the best answer, not because you gamed the algorithm.</li>
            <li><strong>AI Visibility Tracking</strong> — We show you where your brand appears in AI-generated answers, so you can understand and improve your presence through legitimate means.</li>
            <li><strong>Content Briefs</strong> — We help you create content that's structured for both search engines and AI engines because it's well-organized and genuinely useful.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">Why This Matters</h2>
          <p>Spam erodes trust — in communities, in search results, and in AI-generated answers. When everyone spams, everyone loses. Platforms crack down, algorithms adjust, and genuine voices get buried.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">We believe the most durable competitive advantage is being genuinely helpful. VerseSEO is designed to help you find the right conversations, create the right content, and build visibility that lasts — without burning community goodwill or risking platform penalties.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">Accountability</h2>
          <p>We hold ourselves to this standard. If you see anything in our product that feels inconsistent with this pledge, or if you have suggestions for how we can better uphold it, please reach out at <a href="mailto:support@verseseo.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">support@verseseo.com</a>.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
